Flowers for any occasion
MyGlobalFlowers is a marketplace, where you can order flowers and gifts for your beloved ones even if they are thousands of miles away from you.
Local florists, confectioners, artisans and craft masters from all over the world work with us, and we deliver gifts straight to the door of your recipient.
VARIOUS OPTIONS TO CHOOSE FROM
In our catalog you will find different types of flower compositions from classic arrangements with orchids to exotic flowers and yellow roses.
From London to Beijing, from New York City to New Zealand, we have suitable gifts for everyone, no matter where he or she is.
FLOWERS AND GROCERIES FROM LOCAL FLORISTS
Ordering flower and gift delivery to your home or anywhere in the city is easy!
• Select the necessary city;
• Filter gifts and arrangements by occasion;
• Sort by the flowers you need;
• Choose the bouquet you like;
• Specify the recipient's data and make payment. We will contact you for details.
IT’S SAFE WITH US 
• We guarantee the freshness of each bouquet as we get the flowers directly from certified plantations. If you are not satisfied with the quality of flowers, we will replace the bouquet or refund your money;

• We will deliver the flowers knowing only the recipient's phone number. Our specialists will arrange convenient time and place for delivery with your recipient;

• 24-hour customer service is available

• Secure payments and all personal data with state-of-the-art international security protocols;

• Professional florists who lovingly create each bouquet;

• Our flower shop operates worldwide, so we offer delivery of bouquets to over 100 countries.

TRACK YOUR ORDER
To track delivery progress online, just enter your order number.
OUR LOYALTY PROGRAM
For each purchase you get bonus points which you can use to pay up to 50% of your next order.

PAY FROM ANYWHERE
Buying flowers from us is easy thanks to our convenient payment options. You can see prices in a convenient currency and pay for flower delivery via secure systems with no fees:
• Online bank card payment;
• PayPal;
etc.
